.TH ANNOTATION.GENOMICS 2 2000-1月 "write.gff3" "write.gff3"
.SH NAME
write.gff3 \- save the genomics feature annotation table object as a gff3 format
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIwrite.gff3(\fBgff\fR as <generic> GFFTable, 
\fBfile\fR as string);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
save the genomics feature annotation table object as a gff3 format 
 table file
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgff\fB \fR\- 
 a [GFFTable](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Annotation.Assembly.NCBI.GenBank.TabularFormat.GFF.GFFTable) genomics feature annotation table object for 
 save to the target file.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- 
 the file path of the generated gff3 format table file.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a boolean value of the file save result: TRUE means the genomics 
 feature annotation data has been written into the target file 
 successfully.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
annotation.genomics
.SH FILES
.PP
